# a format 22 project, from before knit's Mod page (format 23: TP_KSYNC .. TP_KSUB after TP_O2SHAPE), and its presets
# (format 12: a user preset without the Mod page, the user kits after the presets): saved by that build, for the
# migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit with osc 2 square at +7, level 90, fine +20 cents, saved
# as user preset U1; track 1's kit, its key 2 on model 12, saved as user kit K8.
# Run by a format 22 build (22d9613): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v22.xy
wait 300
bpm 104
param 3 engine knit
param 3 e1 40
param 3 x1 71
param 3 x2 90
param 3 fine 84
param 3 o2wave 2
param 3 o2shape 64
wait 40
usersave 3 1
spin ALGO -2
expect trk 1
param 1 d2.model 12
listen
tap EDIT
tap SEL
row SAVE KIT
turn ALGO 7
wait 300
said K8 (empty)
tap SEL
wait 40
said KIT SAVED
projsave 1 v22_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v22.bin
